 ## Background
-The method originates from standard numerical analysis techniques for approximating derivatives. In volume rendering, it was popularized for adding visual cues like directional light and Phong shading to ray-traced volumes [S1, unofficial]. It is used in scientific visualization tools and libraries, such as CGAL's isosurfacing modules [S18].
